Pick the better hymn using these priorities:
1. Stronger singable hook and chorus memory.
2. Better faithfulness to the source document.
3. Clearer educational progression from intro through ending.
4. Better rhyme, rhythm, and line-to-line lyric flow.
5. More emotionally resonant phrasing without losing clarity.

Prefer the hymn that feels most ready to sing aloud as a finished teaching song.

Reply with only A or B..text.quoted be text ya

